  {
    "id": 2010007030010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……みんな、ありがとう……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030010"
  },
  {
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──智代子、いいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\nはいっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "すみません、突然呼び出したりして──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……決着がついた、か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──今日、みんなに全部聞いてもらったんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "今までの私には、アイドルをやることに対して\r\nどこか『遠慮』みたいなものがあったかもしれないこと",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "自覚はなかったんですけど──",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_nothing",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もしかしたらその理由は、アイドルになったきっかけに\r\nあるのかもしれないって思ったこと",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_nothing",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……オーディションのことだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……はい",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──私は、すごく運がよかったんだと思っています",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "たまたまオーディションに参加することができて、\r\n友達にも、放クラのメンバーにも──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もちろん、プロデューサーさんにも恵まれて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──……たくさんの人に支えてもらって、\r\nアイドルになりました",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だから、私がアイドルでいられることって、\r\nすごい奇跡なんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい、なので……──頑張るぞって、思ってたんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いろんな人にアイドルにしてもらったんだから\r\n……あの子の夢を預かったんだから、頑張るぞって",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "でも、本当はそうじゃなくて\r\n──今回考え直してみて、それじゃ足りないって思って",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "『誰かのために頑張る』んじゃなくて\r\n誰かのために『私がアイドルでいたいから』頑張るって",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あの子からの預かりものだったアイドルを──\r\nちゃんと自分のものにしたいって、思ったんだって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030200,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そういう話をみんなにしました",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030210,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "でもそれってほんとのほんとに初歩の話ですし",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030220,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "今までそんなこともわからないまま活動してて\r\nごめんなさいって、謝りました",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……みんなはなんて？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030230,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
