  {
    "id": 2010007030260,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "『友達の代わりにアイドルをやってるんだ』って\r\n思ってたのかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030270,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いつだって本気で、全力で、\r\n真っ直ぐなみんなと一緒にいたのに",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030280,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私だけそうじゃなかったのかもしれない……！\r\n──だから、本当にごめんなさい！！",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000703/2010007030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007030290,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……──でも\r\nこれからは変われるように頑張るから",
